00:46:38.796 --> 00:46:44.343
Kissed the girls and made them cry.

746
00:46:53.352 --> 00:46:55.186
[indistinct audio on video]

747
00:46:55.187 --> 00:47:00.526
When the boys came out to play...

748
00:47:01.861 --> 00:47:04.488
[girl screaming on video]

749
00:47:07.408 --> 00:47:12.663
Georgie Porgie ran away.

750
00:47:14.457 --> 00:47:17.209
[screaming continues]

751
00:47:43.527 --> 00:47:45.529
[♪ eerie music playing]

752
00:48:09.678 --> 00:48:10.929
[whispering] Got you.

753
00:48:10.930 --> 00:48:13.891
[♪ "Wonderful Illusion"
by Eartha Kitt playing]

754
00:48:30.032 --> 00:48:35.286
<i>♪ What is this wonderful illusion ♪</i>

755
00:48:35.287 --> 00:48:40.417
<i>♪ This ever-burning flame ♪</i>

756
00:48:40.418 --> 00:48:45.505
<i>♪ That fills me with
a strange confusion ♪</i>

757
00:48:45.506 --> 00:48:50.969
<i>♪ Each time I hear your name ♪</i>

758
00:48:50.970 --> 00:48:56.683
<i>♪ There is something in your eyes
and in your sighs ♪</i>

759
00:48:56.684 --> 00:49:01.354
<i>♪ That speaks of heaven ♪</i>

760
00:49:01.355 --> 00:49:07.360
<i>♪ In the warmth of your caress
I must confess ♪</i>

761
00:49:07.361 --> 00:49:11.364
<i>♪ I'm yours alone ♪</i>

762
00:49:11.365 --> 00:49:16.453
<i>♪ This sweet and wonderful illusion ♪</i>

763
00:49:16.454 --> 00:49:21.916
<i>♪ I've never known before ♪</i>

764
00:49:21.917 --> 00:49:24.752
<i>♪ It was born the night we met ♪</i>

765
00:49:24.753 --> 00:49:28.339
<i>♪ I can't forget ♪</i>

766
00:49:28.340 --> 00:49:31.177
<i>♪ That magic moment... ♪</i>
